MID_SE_Orh_Nin_C: <EDH>
MID_SE_Orh_Nin_C_001: It's fun to go shopping by myself, though I wish\nthe streets weren't so packed.
MID_SE_Orh_Nin_C_002: Oh my, they seem to be in a hurry. I wonder where\nthey're going.
MID_SE_Orh_Nin_C_003: I heard they caught a criminal. Let's go see what he\nlooks like!
MID_SE_Orh_Nin_C_004: Goodness. It's so crowded today that I can barely\nwalk around.
MID_SE_Orh_Nin_C_005: Pitiable, pitiable Lead Priest Orchel.
MID_SE_Orh_Nin_C_006: Ninae! How did you know I was here?
MID_SE_Orh_Nin_C_007: Whenever I don't know the lead priest's\nwhereabouts, I find them out.
MID_SE_Orh_Nin_C_008: This is a dangerous place for you. Let's pull you out\nof that danger.
MID_SE_Orh_Nin_C_009: Oh my. How gallant of you!
MID_SE_Orh_Nin_C_010: I do feel safer now that you're here. Shall we?
MID_SE_Orh_Nin_C_011: Above you, Lead Priest. A vase waits for your\npassing.
MID_SE_Orh_Nin_C_012: Oh my! Thanks for the warning, Ninae.
MID_SE_Orh_Nin_C_013: I was only relaying the message I was meant to relay.
MID_SE_Orh_Nin_C_014: Oh? But where did the message come from?
MID_SE_Orh_Nin_C_015: Ah. Was it you? Did you pass the message?
MID_SE_Orh_Nin_C_016: Ninae? Is someone here?
MID_SE_Orh_Nin_C_017: I see. Dark portents swirl around us. Thank you for\nthe news of their swirling.
MID_SE_Orh_Nin_C_018: Disaster is in the wind. I will not be a hazard to you.
MID_SE_Orh_Nin_C_019: Ninae, wait! You don't have to go.
MID_SE_Orh_Nin_C_020: The disaster in the wind will strike if I do not.\nStay away, Lead Priest Orchel.
MID_SE_Orh_Nin_C_021: No! I'm not going to let you fend for yourself in\nthis crowd.
MID_SE_Orh_Nin_C_022: Besides, you seem like one of those people who\nshouldn't be left alone.
MID_SE_Orh_Nin_C_023: So I'll watch over you too, Ninae! Now get\nbehind me...
MID_SE_Orh_Nin_C_024: Where did she go? Ninae? Ninae!
MID_SE_Orh_Nin_C_025: Yes...isolation is best. An isolated place like the sea\nor mountains.
MID_SE_Orh_Nin_C_026: How did you get over there?! Wait, Ninae! You're\ngoing the wrong way!
